on the axis t. Let X = (X1, ..., Xk), k ≥2 be some set of random variables, we denote the distribution function of
the random variable Xi by Fi(xi), i = 1, .., k and its joint distribution by FX(x1, ..., xk). We say that the random
variables of this set are independent if
